# Built-in pack images (packages/seed/build-packs.mjs) are immutable: the phone
# may cache them for a year without revalidating. RULE: never change a file's
# content under the same name. New or changed art gets a new file name (and a
# new item.image_key in the seed / a migration), so clients fetch it fresh.
# CORS: the app draws locked items as a CSS mask, which needs a CORS response.
/builtin/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
